      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "探讨这个主因后，\n她的弱点似乎呼之欲出了。\n在接下来的“朝日杯FS”前必须克服才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf6afc55a568c54b813b26078a8b35e997799ac87b060fd9b748deaf00365e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
