    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17bf4229b2fb37f9208c346d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁的出色表现震撼了观众。\n观众席上的菱亚马逊\n似乎也因为她的表现而点燃了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f769e0d7a387cb03f98623806150c248e7ff9b25c26d165945523192ff374c7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
