      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147257f5bba8c915b55fc562",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁称霸“皋月赏”，令观众陷入狂热，\n大家都说三冠赛马娘也非她莫属！\n这也给同世代的赛马娘带来不小的冲击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d3837be3326a2b5a0cfa035955b124aeaa0568996740b6d872b3837763741e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f327e788bd84ff0de4058e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "知道同世代中也有强敌后，\n成田白仁感受到前所未有的亢奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b3c6bf0ea122cc8cf5829fb2f387ba30db7e46bef0fe236577a427f9f337dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ced6dcba04c25dede03f667",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛，\n她即将参加经典三冠的第二战“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c856327c9d1707663158f701e99640e1dea35365e912cc0a2a5419ff8e694d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b2c1fb4f539063c40bb91d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・期待",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da275ead188e32bfa906f75f4f91c4576561611b1f02ecef8a5acd0a932ffce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016431.json",
