    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e449d1c7ca0605a8c5e30799",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁错失“皋月赏”冠军。\n她察觉到自己的天真，并发誓下次绝不会输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9f3b621b3822538b921f02fc8a9c366d2b3e0f7b8631fa11a36a0d240f69c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
