    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2962c483701c0cbac6a142",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然与冠军失之交臂，\n但她的表现给同世代赛马娘带来了冲击。\n记者们纷纷报导此事，并称她为“怪物”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48eac9d686b90a5114b950dde063efbfe55895e8689a00b8be73c2fbb430e378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
