    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbefb5a2bbe3d6817b184f9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁称霸“日本德比”，\n漂亮地夺下了两冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662a398f14f5123dc4a95c21a1aa26b9da4fe3cc747d324b4c567e242337bd66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5662850cd76fa8a19c6c2d0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世人对她的期待越来越高涨，\n还有传言说她有机会成为三冠赛马娘。\n成田白仁也展现了强烈的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2daad58f7a394deb2859bfd8a0adadc9f389d315aecd2452fe75ff3c31254a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eb4a48e2f82f8ae3fa3e68e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，菱亚马逊也在\n三后冠路线夺下了两冠。\n两人决定要在“有马纪念”一决高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a825f2b2eec02bc17bf654280880a263b92bb867bc7a894058f09667ec44db",
